UI, add the connectors.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:33.660
And boom, all of a sudden,
you are done and gone.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.160
The next step up,
if you really want

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.180
to do a little bit more
work, is that App Maker

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:39.342
runs on top of App
Script, which is

00:10:39.342 --> 00:10:41.800
Google's JavaScript in the
cloud environment that gives you

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:47.760
access and your apps access to
data and Google Apps, G Suite.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:49.870
You can access other
Google services.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.400
But you can also
make external calls

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:55.120
to like an outside
relational database.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:57.040
And then for the
hardcore soft developers,

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:00.190
then we have the REST APIs
where you can actually

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:04.180
integrate Google Drive, Gmail,
calendar, sheets, and slides

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.705
into your applications.

00:11:05.705 --> 00:11:07.150
DREA ALPHONSO: Oh,
a lot of stiff.

