00:11:14.733 --> 00:11:17.290
This morning, we announced
that Team Drives is generally

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:20.160
available, which is really
exciting because now you

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:22.404
know if employees
move or change jobs,

00:11:22.404 --> 00:11:23.820
you don't have to
worry about, oh,

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.940
who do we reassign the
ownership to, right?

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:26.760
It's crazy.

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.140
So everything is owned
by the organization.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:32.060
And Team Drives is accessible
from the Drive API as well.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:34.162
So your apps can integrate
with Team Drives.

00:11:34.162 --> 00:11:36.370
The other announcement that
was exciting this morning

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:41.230
was Gmail add-ons, where you
can integrate your mini app

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:44.590
and have it built into Gmail so
that they can access your app

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:46.870
without having to leave Gmail.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.642
It's kind of like breaking
the cycle of, oh, I'm

00:11:49.642 --> 00:11:50.350
