00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.380
Oh, I've get a pop
out, go to another app.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:53.760
And then, oh, I've got
to get back into Gmail.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:54.730
DREA ALPHONSO: Too many clicks!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.550
WES CHUN: Exactly.

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:57.440
And your context
is kind of crazy.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.400
So if you can actually build
in a little bit of your app

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.310
